 {
  "description": "Fancy a free coffee and a chat? We\u2019re here for you.\r\n\r\nWe know avenues for independent and freelance writers seeking guidance can be limited, and the challenges for those developing creative careers can feel overwhelming. So, we\u2019re here to help talk it out with regular, light-touch career surgeries for Writers\u2019 Card Members.\r\n\r\nOnce a month on a Monday afternoon, we\u2019ll offer up the expertise of the Royal Court\u2019s staff team to discuss anything that\u2019s on your mind. Primarily hosted in our Bar & Kitchen \u2013 with tea and coffee on us \u2013 we\u2019ll also offer zoom options for those who can\u2019t make it in person.\r\n\r\nTopics could include career trajectories, finding opportunities, producing and marketing your own work, accessing funding and support, goat herding, telekinesis, and more - anything where a 20-minute chat might genuinely help or be a useful sounding-board. And from time to time, we\u2019ll offer special sessions dedicated to key areas of expertise.\r\n\r\nSlots are available for Members only, in-person at the Royal Court Bar & Kitchen, or via Zoom.\r\n\r\nPlaces are first-come, first-served and the booking portal will open two weeks in advance of each surgery date.",
